WEBVTT

00:00:29.179 --> 00:00:32.155
of its more than 22,000 dialects.

00:00:32.179 --> 00:00:34.365
So I don't think I've really
earned the right

00:00:34.389 --> 00:00:36.811
to call myself an Indian.

00:00:36.835 --> 00:00:38.359
And if "Where do you come from?"

00:00:38.383 --> 00:00:41.426
means "Where were you born
and raised and educated?"

00:00:41.450 --> 00:00:43.852
then I'm entirely
of that funny little country

00:00:43.876 --> 00:00:45.223
known as England,

00:00:45.247 --> 00:00:47.634
except I left England
as soon as I completed

00:00:47.658 --> 00:00:49.547
my undergraduate education,

00:00:49.571 --> 00:00:51.264
and all the time I was growing up,

00:00:51.288 --> 00:00:54.060
I was the only kid in all my classes

00:00:54.084 --> 00:00:57.189
who didn't begin to look
like the classic English heroes

00:00:57.213 --> 00:00:59.867
represented in our textbooks.

00:00:59.891 --> 00:01:01.169
And if "Where do you come from?"